From a vanilla perspective, jumping's often preferrable to speed boots
especially in the late game (Astral/Valley).
]oDex are nearly useless, so you can swap out for swimming without
losing anything.

Short of something like polyself into a crystal golem, you're probably
going to go with an artifact for drain resistance (for an arch, it's
easy to wield Excalibur.  Stormbringer and the Hand of Vecna are other
possibilities).

Otherwise you're looking at giving up the amulet slot (for "oDR or for
Deep DSM/CoMR/"oReflection).


